    "description": "Spec article — prose fields (description / notes / intent) that point into a YAML texts file with {\"md\": \"key\"} and render as Markdown. Covers the paired-file rule and named files, dotted key paths, how the text renders on generated pages, the rules jsonui-doc validate enforces (measured output), how every reader receives the text (read_spec_file returns {md, text}), and when to keep prose inline. jsonui-cli 1.9.3+.",
